{"2636460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dungeons Deep", "steam_appid": 2636460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About our game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeons Deep is a hardcore dungeon crawler set in a dark fantasy world. Battle goblins, demons, skeletons, spiders, dragons and many more creatures. Play alone or with your friends. Our story follows an order of soldiers and mercenaries that return to the plagued kingdom of Antioch. Their quest is to plunder the depths for ancient artifacts, and rid the former kingdom of creatures that lurk in the darkness, preying on those who remain in these lands. Although some come for more clandestine purposes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636460/extras/2cb0f896d3610e0a82a2997718ac2806.webp?t=1785342732\" width=616 height=34 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play single-player or co-op, planned up to 4 players.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of intricately crafted locations that are procedurally re-arranged so that every playthrough is different.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Omni-directional aiming based combat, with full gamepad support.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloody dismemberment system. What good is hacking and slashing if nothing comes off?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deeply satisfying combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy difficulty in Dungeons Deep is largely based on the different tactics and behaviors of the creatures you're fighting. In many cases they will learn what you’re doing and change tactics. Mistakes will be punished. In order to survive you must learn your enemies' weaknesses, and exploit them quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636460/extras/41ed5f4b895cc6a276db59d2f04bf907.poster.avif?t=1785342732\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636460/extras/41ed5f4b895cc6a276db59d2f04bf907.webm?t=1785342732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636460/extras/41ed5f4b895cc6a276db59d2f04bf907.mp4?t=1785342732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Never play the same dungeon twice, while avoiding the common pitfalls of proc gen</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-crafted rooms are procedurally re-arranged every time you enter the dungeon for a fresh experience. These locations feature a wide variety of themes with variations of enemies and bosses selected from the numerous factions. This means you will never play the same dungeon twice, bringing a new challenge every time you step in without the typical pitfall empty feeling fully-procedural dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your character, played your way</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persistent progression and an open skill tree means with each level and skill point you choose your characters path. There are no weapon restrictions so any class can wield whatever you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot vomit!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of satisfying loot options over several rarity types that will boost your abilities and help you specialize your character. You can also find and mine resources to craft weapons and armor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636460/extras/fb1c684bf1ff80e4a0e940a185739e4d.poster.avif?t=1785342732\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636460/extras/fb1c684bf1ff80e4a0e940a185739e4d.webm?t=1785342732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636460/extras/fb1c684bf1ff80e4a0e940a185739e4d.mp4?t=1785342732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your camp</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your gold to build your camp with upgrades that will help you tackle quests. Bring in a blacksmith to sell or forge exotic weapons, or a sorcerer to unlock magical scrolls. Hire mercenaries to assist you on your journeys or pack mules to carry your loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636460/extras/557428c87b3f2c805345131c04de6670.poster.avif?t=1785342732\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636460/extras/557428c87b3f2c805345131c04de6670.webm?t=1785342732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636460/extras/557428c87b3f2c805345131c04de6670.mp4?t=1785342732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636460/extras/2cb0f896d3610e0a82a2997718ac2806.webp?t=1785342732\" width=616 height=34 /></span></p>", "about_the_game":